# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting. Biome formats to LF, so without this a
# Windows checkout produces a CRLF working tree that fails `biome check` on
# every single file — the failure mode the editor monorepo currently has.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.glb binary
